  Note that the boundary of the Borel set $(-\infty,x] \subset \mathbb{R}$ is
  the singleton $\partial (-\infty,x] = \left\{ x \right\}$.
  Therefore the assumption $\lim_{n \to \infty} \mu_n = \mu$ implies that
  \begin{align*}
